> Converted from personal notes. Amounts are for one serving. Directions are editorial, not verified source instructions.

== Ingredients ==

Gather the following ingredients: @chicken thighs{3/10%lb} (sliced), @coconut milk{2/5%can} (can size 13.5 oz ea), @gluten-free chicken broth{3/5%cup}, @mushrooms{8/5%oz} (sliced), @lemongrass{2/5%stalk} (bruised), @galangal{6/5%slice}, @makrut lime leaves{1}, @Thai chilies{2/5} (sliced), @gluten-free fish sauce{2/5%tbsp}, @lime juice{3/5%tbsp}, @brown sugar{2/5%tsp}, @cilantro{1/20%cup} (chopped), @green onions{2/5} (sliced).

== Preparation ==

Bruise the lemongrass and slice the galangal. Gently simmer the coconut milk, broth and aromatics, then add chicken and mushrooms and cook the chicken fully. Finish with fish sauce, lime juice and sugar; garnish with cilantro and green onion. Remove tough aromatics before eating.
